{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/144620-demon-review-n-months-in","id":144620,"title":"Demon Review N Months In...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-21T10:47:26-07:00","id":144620,"title":"Demon Review N Months In...","content":"Now that you all have been running Demon for a while (I'm guessing):<br /> <br /> - how terrific is it (or is it terrific)<br /> - what have you learned or done differently based on actual play<br /> - what have you house ruled?<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/354-pencilboy99","name":"PencilBoy99","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T12:07:08-07:00","id":144672,"title":"","content":"I Haven't run it yet but i will next week. I've been a player in about 2 1/2 stories though.<br /> <br /> 1. I think it's pretty awesome personally.<br /> <br /> 2. I've learned that I have the most fun when the ring <i>isn't</i> specifically together but rather when most people are split up and seeing the story unfold in their own little portions. That way, we as players get the intrigue of seeing the little pieces and we also get those whammy moments when we share information with our ring via either dead drops or actual verbal communication and then we get pieces of information that all of a sudden make the info we've gathered all of a sudden make sense. When that happens, it's incredibly satisfying. <br /> <br /> Of coarse, we have mostly played up the 'spy' themes of hiding and cover and paranoia. I hope when I start my game, my players will get that too.<br /> <br /> 3. Nothing so far. But we prolly will once my group gets a story or two into the chronicle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T13:46:20-07:00","id":144819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PencilBoy99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/144620-demon-review-n-months-in#post144620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now that you all have been running Demon for a while (I'm guessing):<br /> <br /> - how terrific is it (or is it terrific)</div> </div> </div> </div> Lovin' it.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> - what have you learned or done differently based on actual play </div> </div> </div> That player buy in is huge with Demon. If you want to run around, ignore the spy thing, and be &quot;vulgar?&quot; Its actually easy to do. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> - what have you house ruled? </div> </div> </div> There's a things that were covered, mostly to prevent abuse - excessive amount of successes from partial forms to get free xp, for instance. The transfer consequence power was adapted to make it more in line with the feel of embeds - no taking damage then giving it away to the guy who hit you. Assuming demonic form (but not going loud) uses (10-Premium) for compromise checks instead of affecting a Covers. A few tweaks, here and there, to aether sense, mostly to justify running into other demons more.<br /> <br /> Probably the biggest thing was the introduction of &quot;holy objects&quot; to give to the cultists who confront demons, which kind of served as a new Demon bane, ala Changeling and iron. Mechanically, these probably could just be angelic gadgets, but there's something about dealing with fanatics armed with holy water and blessed swords that can hurt you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Thanks! </div> </div> </div>Welcome!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T18:05:10-07:00","id":147385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PencilBoy99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/144620-demon-review-n-months-in#post144620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">- how terrific is it (or is it terrific)</div> </div> </div> </div>It tickles a bone that I didn't realize I wanted tickled. And that's a good thing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> - what have you learned or done differently based on actual play </div> </div> </div>Player knowledge and confidence has to be built to match those of the characters. Games should be arranged based on agendas and facts, rather like a mage game, though it's far more a thriller than a mystery sort of context. Demons are amazingly slippery and that's a very interesting problem with all sorts of implications, making them some of the best antagonists. That being said, using proxies and finding things for players to care about and invest in is key as well.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> - what have you house ruled? </div> </div> </div>I <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/147367-compromise-conditions\">changed the Conditions</a> for success on a Compromise roll for flavor and interest reasons. I came up with some quick and dirty tradecraft rules to kind of cover up for lack of player knowledge in some cases. I clarified Compromises in a demonic form to be based on the previous Cover since that is the point that &quot;reality&quot; registers the break as some sort of quantum observer (I borrow liberally from real, popsci, and scifi concepts of quantum mechanics for the flavor of the game a lot really), and I rebalanced a lot of Exploits, Embeds, and Demonic Form abilities to have more Contested effects, as I felt some of the Resisted ones were too &quot;save or die&quot; except you don't even get a save (read: Knockout Blow), and since in my game the main antagonists are fellow demons I felt it'd be appropriate to make defenses more active.<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/144620-demon-review-n-months-in?p=144819#post144819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Probably the biggest thing was the introduction of &quot;holy objects&quot; to give to the cultists who confront demons, which kind of served as a new Demon bane, ala Changeling and iron. Mechanically, these probably could just be angelic gadgets, but there's something about dealing with fanatics armed with holy water and blessed swords that can hurt you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Totally going to yoink this. Even have a perfect name for them: Instruments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3058-juvenaliansatyr","name":"JuvenalianSatyr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3058_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T14:07:51-07:00","id":171014,"title":"","content":"Can you share any of your stuff like tradecraft?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/354-pencilboy99","name":"PencilBoy99","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}